      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the kitchen of restaurant Victor, Max greets Vika and asks whether she knows the sex of their baby yet. When Vika coldly tells him she owes him nothing because he always lies, Max vows in front of the entire staff to speak only the truth.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Привет, малыш!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
